# n8n automations

- Next.js owns forms, validation, `DocumentJob` persistence, and downloads.
- n8n owns template rendering and multi-step document assembly.
- Every outbound webhook includes `jobId`, `callbackUrl`, and HMAC signature.
- Callbacks: `POST /api/webhooks/n8n` — verify secret, idempotent by `jobId`.
- Separate webhook URLs for CV and derecho de petición.
- Never block the HTTP request waiting for long n8n runs; queue job then poll/refresh status.
- See skills: `cv-generation`, `derecho-peticion`, `n8n-workflows`.
